meta {
  name: Get Next Reminder
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/reminder/next
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Next Reminder

  This request is used to get the nearest reminder. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — reminder fetched successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "reminder fetched",
    "data": {
      "reminder_title": "service berkala",
      "reminder_context": "Service",
      "reminder_body": "at 90.000 KM",
      "remind_at": "2025-09-05 00:00:00",
      "vehicle_id": "2d98f524-de02-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002"
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — reminder failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "reminder not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}